# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Umbra · Waxing Crescent — frontend config
# Copy to `.env` (or `.env.local`) and adjust only if you need to override the
# defaults. Everything here is PUBLIC config — there are NO secrets in this app.
# The wallet lives in the Lace browser extension; your secret key never leaves
# your machine. `.env*` is gitignored anyway, as a matter of hygiene.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# If set, the app pre-fills the "Join an existing board" field with this address
# so visitors land straight on your deployed board. Paste your deployed contract
# address here after you run the in-app "Deploy a new board" flow once.
VITE_UMBRA_CONTRACT_ADDRESS=

# The app reads indexer / proof-server / node URIs directly from the connected
# Lace wallet (its service-uri config), so you normally do NOT need to set these.
# Uncomment to force an override (advanced).
# VITE_INDEXER_URI=
# VITE_INDEXER_WS_URI=
# VITE_PROOF_SERVER_URI=
